# GUIShop Quick Reference

GUIShop is a Minecraft Bukkit/Spigot shop plugin with GUI-based item browsing, buying, selling, and an in-game creator/editor mode. It also includes optional internal economy and statistics tracking.

## Quick Links to Other Rules
- `guishop-architecture.mdc` - Core classes, caches, and structure
- `guishop-item-flow.mdc` - Loading, editing, saving items
- `guishop-patterns-pitfalls.mdc` - Common patterns and bug fixes
- `guishop-worth-display.mdc` - Packet-based worth lore injection
- `guishop-economy.mdc` - Internal economy system
- `guishop-statistics.mdc` - Player statistics and PlaceholderAPI
- `guishop-special-items.mdc` - Spawners, potions, fireworks, heads

