## Key Global State

```java
GUIShop.getINSTANCE().getLoadedShops()  // Map<String, ShopItem>
GUIShop.getINSTANCE().getLoadedMenu()   // MenuItem
GUIShop.getCREATOR()                    // Set<UUID> players in edit mode
```

## Critical Flow Summary

**Normal shop access:**
```
/shop → PlayerListener.openMenu() → Menu.loadItems() → Menu.open()
Click shop button → Shop.loadItems() → Shop.open()
```

**Creator mode editing:**
```
/gs edit → Add to CREATOR set → Open Menu/Shop in creator mode
Right-click item → ItemEditorGui opens
Save → Update cache directly → Rebuild GUI → Show updated shop
Close shop → saveCreatorInventory() → Remove from CREATOR set
```

